take down those two.

00:22:33.986 --> 00:22:35.354
Well, whatever.

00:22:36.522 --> 00:22:38.557
You get lost, too!

00:22:39.291 --> 00:22:41.727
Come on! Have at you!

00:22:41.727 --> 00:22:43.562
Here I come!

00:22:47.099 --> 00:22:48.500
I felt that...

00:22:51.604 --> 00:22:54.173
That's nothing to write home about.

00:22:54.506 --> 00:22:58.277
I never thought Don Patch
was hiding so much power...

00:22:58.277 --> 00:22:59.645
I can't believe it!

00:22:59.645 --> 00:23:02.381
And those sunglasses
had nothing to do with it!

00:23:02.615 --> 00:23:06.385
Don Patch, you have to tell me...
Where did all that strength come from?

00:23:06.852 --> 00:23:08.954
Alright, I'll let you in
on everything I know.

00:23:08.954 --> 00:23:12.358
But first I have to explain

00:23:12.358 --> 00:23:14.960
this scar on my left eye.

00:23:15.995 --> 00:23:18.931
| knew it, I've been wondering
about that since episode 1!

00:23:18.931 --> 00:23:22.468
You liar, he didn't even
have that in episode 1!

00:23:22.468 --> 00:23:25.671
Don Patch was hiding
tremendous amounts of strength!

00:23:25.671 --> 00:23:29.108
But is this scar a memoir of battle,

00:23:29.108 --> 00:23:31.844
or a souvenir of a matrimonial quarrel?

00:23:32.177 --> 00:23:34.313
You old men, I hope
you don't forget this!

00:23:38.484 --> 00:23:41.720
Always remember to
stretch before swimming!

00:23:42.488 --> 00:23:45.124
Huh? What will become of Bo-bobo?

00:23:45.991 --> 00:23:48.661
Just ask your nosehairs!

00:23:48.661 --> 00:23:51.330
They probably know
something about what's going on!

00:24:00.172 --> 00:24:04.476
When the cherry
blossoms bloom, I remember...

00:24:04.476 --> 00:24:10.082
...the gentle dawn that
will never come back.

00:24:11.450 --> 00:24:15.788
| used to wish I would be hurt,

00:24:15.788 --> 00:24:22.428
because I thought being
hurt would make me happy.

00:24:22.428 --> 00:24:25.431
I lost things and broke things...

00:24:25.431 --> 00:24:27.900
I understood so many things

00:24:27.900 --> 00:24:33.772
This year the cherry
blossoms will sway too!

00:24:33.772 --> 00:24:40.980
My hazy feelings will
disappear with the wind.

00:24:42.214 --> 00:24:44.984
What was I drawing again...

00:24:44.984 --> 00:24:47.886
...that had so much hate in it?

00:24:47.886 --> 00:24:51.123
How many times will I go in circles...

00:24:51.757 --> 00:24:53.425
...before I understand
what weakness is?

00:24:53.425 --> 00:24:56.195
I'm struggling and crying again,

00:24:56.195 --> 00:24:59.331
but that doesn't mean
I can't keep going!

00:25:00.165 --> 00:25:02.368
To the future ahead of us

00:25:11.744 --> 00:25:14.213
Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo

00:25:14.580 --> 00:25:15.948
He's getting married?

00:25:15.948 --> 00:25:17.716
Who? Could it be me?

00:25:17.716 --> 00:25:18.984
That guy! THAT guy!

00:25:18.984 --> 00:25:20.152
I'm excited for the party!

00:25:20.152 --> 00:25:21.653
I think it's a trap...

00:25:21.653 --> 00:25:24.289
Oh, no! I don't have any
good clothes to wear!

00:25:24.289 --> 00:25:26.692
Are you listening?
It's gotta be a trap!

00:25:26.692 --> 00:25:29.061
Come to think of it, Don Patch
doesn't actually wear clothes.

00:25:29.061 --> 00:25:30.929
No, I want to go to the party!

00:25:30.929 --> 00:25:32.798
It's a TRAP, I say!

00:25:32.798 --> 00:25:34.733
Next time on Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo:

00:25:34.733 --> 00:25:37.736
<i>Welcome to the Evil Blood Mansion! The Return of the Duck Underwear!!
Welcome to the Evil Blood Mansion! The Return of the Duck Underwear!</i>

00:25:37.736 --> 00:25:37.803
Welcome to the Evil Blood Mansion! The Return of the
Duck Underwear!! Don't tell me he's coming back!?

00:25:37.803 --> 00:25:39.505
Don't tell me he's coming back!?

00:25:42.508 --> 00:25:45.477
Here's the results of the
Janken Forture Teller, nah-na-la!

00:25:45.477 --> 00:25:50.516
If you won, your lucky
color is Don Patch-color!

00:25:51.450 --> 00:25:54.453
If you had a tie or lost,
look out for Serviceman!
